### 4. Corrected the release package assembly

The uploaded ZIP included thousands of `node_modules` files even though `.gitignore` excluded that directory. The Phase 0 candidate is repackaged without `node_modules`, `.env`, or live `data/`. It retains `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, the bundled OCR language model, workbook, source, fixtures, tests and reports. The Windows user has already shown that `npm ci` works against the v2.5.0 lockfile; a clean install against this newly packaged copy should still be confirmed.

