## Release recommendation

Phase 0 baseline reconciliation is complete. The interactive-panel test harness is fixed, the report runner can preserve independent results, a fresh fallback baseline has been captured, and a clean ZIP assembly without `node_modules` is ready. This is not an OCR accuracy fix or a production-ready fallback release. Proceed to the sequential lifecycle phase and then field-accuracy work, using the reports in `testdata/phase0-baseline/` as the new baseline.
